NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000262 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000263 "This document describes version 0.212 of App::ShellCompleter::cpanm (from Perl distribution App-ShellCompleter-cpanm), released on 2023-07-08."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000264 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000265 "=head1 SYNOPSIS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000266 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000267 "See L<_cpanm> included in this distribution."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000268 ""
