NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000272 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000273 "Please visit the project's homepage at L<https://metacpan.org/release/App-ShellCompleter-cpanm>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000274 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000275 "=head1 SOURCE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000276 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000277 "Source repository is at L<https://github.com/perlancar/perl-App-BashCompleter-cpanm>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000278 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000279 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000280 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000281 "L<Bash::Completion::Plugins::cpanm>, which focuses on completing module name"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000282 "remotely using MetaCPAN API. This module, on the other hand, focuses on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000283 "completing C<cpanm> command-line options."
