NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000288 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000289 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000290 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000291 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000292 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000293 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000294 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000295 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000296 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000297 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000298 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000299 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000300 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000301 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000302 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000303 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000304 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000305 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
